name: Dependency input limits fail honestly and recover with explicit declared allowance
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/sbom_budget.py @TMP_TARGET @ART prepare
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
submit: logs
require-live-snap: 20 LOGS | inventory-origin
submit: run sbom-scan:scan {"maxTotalBytes":2}
require-live-snap: 30 maxTotalBytes 2 | refused-input
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/sbom_budget.py @TMP_TARGET @ART failed
submit: scene
require-live-snap: 20 KUZUSHI VIZ | gallery
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 20 Component inventory failed | failed-components
expect: options sbom-scan:scan
expect-not: owned-library
resize: 40x12
live-snap: failed-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: failure-recovery-page-1-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: failure-recovery-page-2-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: failure-recovery-page-3-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: failure-recovery-page-4-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: failure-recovery-page-5-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: failure-recovery-page-6-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: failure-recovery-page-7-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: failure-recovery-page-8-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: failure-recovery-page-9-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: failure-recovery-page-10-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: failure-recovery-page-11-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: failure-recovery-page-12-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: failure-recovery-page-13-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: failure-recovery-page-14-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: failure-recovery-page-15-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: failure-recovery-page-16-40x12
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/sbom_budget.py @TMP_TARGET @ART failure-pages
ask: Does the refused input show its real byte limit and a usable recovery path without retaining current package claims?
resize: 120x36
keys: Escape
submit: options sbom-scan:scan
require-live-snap: 20 Max total bytes | declared-option
keys: Down
require-live-snap: 20 maxTotalBytes | declared-limit
live-snap: allowance-options
keys: Escape
submit: logs
require-live-snap: 20 LOGS | recovery-origin
paste-file: @ART/recovery-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 sbom-scan: 2 components | completed-inventory
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/sbom_budget.py @TMP_TARGET @ART completed
submit: scene
require-live-snap: 20 COMPONENT STACK | recovered-components
expect: owned-library
expect: declared ^1.0
expect: 1.2.3
expect: Source freshness is unverified
expect-not: Map ✓
expect-not: Scan ✓
resize: 160x48
live-snap: recovered-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: recovered-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: recovered-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: recovered-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: recovered-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: recovered-details-page-1-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: recovered-details-page-2-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: recovered-details-page-3-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: recovered-details-page-4-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: recovered-details-page-5-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: recovered-details-page-6-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: recovered-details-page-7-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: recovered-details-page-8-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: recovered-details-page-9-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: recovered-details-page-10-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: recovered-details-page-11-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: recovered-details-page-12-40x12
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/sbom_budget.py @TMP_TARGET @ART component-pages
ask: Are dependency versions and their freshness limit readable across the viewport matrix after a separately requested bounded rerun?
resize: 120x36
keys: Escape
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: scene
require-live-snap: 20 KUZUSHI VIZ | restarted-gallery
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 20 declared ^1.0 | restarted-components
expect: 1.2.3
expect-not: Map ✓
expect-not: Scan ✓
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/sbom_budget.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does no-color restart recollect components while retaining both run receipts without model calls, source execution, discovery jobs or invented workflow progress?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
